          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="dc-fit__col dc-fit__col--out">
          <h3 class="ac-type-h3-home-route">Probably not a fit</h3>
          <ul class="dc-minus-list">
            {poorFit.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
          </ul>
          <p class="dc-fit__aside">
            If the home is already empty and needs a full reset before move-in or after move-out,
            this service still applies — tell us the timing when you request an estimate. Where
            the property still has to be cleared of contents first,
            <a href="/property-cleanouts-san-jose/"> property cleanouts</a> or
            <a href="/hoarding-cleanup-san-jose/"> hoarding cleanup</a> may be the earlier step.
            Where the condition is past normal housekeeping,
            <a href="/extreme-cleaning-san-jose/"> extreme-condition cleaning</a> is the closer
            match. Not sure? Send photos. We will say whether it sounds like a fit, and we will
            say so when it is not.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dc-price">
