            heavy kitchen and bathroom buildup, are not the same job at the same size. Condition
            and the amount of detail work you want both move the price.
          </p>
          <p class="dc-price__fee">{site.offer.assessmentFraming(site.offer.assessmentFee)}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="dc-price__drivers">
          <p class="dc-price__label">What moves the number</p>
          <ul class="dc-rule-list dc-rule-list--tight">
            {priceDrivers.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ══ 07 · QUESTIONS ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
